[Your application]
  Path operation functions r: Your code, description: Endpoint functions you decorate; examples in docs_src/first_steps/tutorial001_py310.py

[fastapi package]
  FastAPI r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/applications.py:52; subclass of Starlette
  APIRouter r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/routing.py:2327; collects APIRoute objects
  APIRoute r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/routing.py:1179; one route per path operation
  get_request_handler r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/routing.py:397; builds the per-request coroutine
  solve_dependencies r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/dependencies/utils.py:643
  ModelField r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/_compat/v2.py:114; wraps a Pydantic TypeAdapter
  get_openapi r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/openapi/utils.py:577; builds the schema
  Swagger UI and ReDoc pages r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/openapi/docs.py; loads Swagger UI from a CDN
  Security schemes r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/security/oauth2.py; http.py; api_key.py
  Telemetry r: FastAPI core, description: fastapi/telemetry/_api.py:35; OpenTelemetry spans

[Runtime dependencies]
  Starlette r: Built on, description: ASGI routing; requests; responses; middleware; pyproject.toml:45
  Pydantic r: Built on, description: Validation and serialization; pyproject.toml:46
  OpenTelemetry API r: Built on, description: pyproject.toml:50
  Uvicorn and fastapi-cli r: Built on, description: Optional standard extra; pyproject.toml:68;80

[Repo tooling]
  scripts/docs.py r: Repo tooling, description: Builds the docs site in many languages
  scripts/translate.py r: Repo tooling, description: LLM translation of the English docs
  tests with pytest r: Repo tooling, description: tests/ run by .github/workflows/test.yml

Path operation functions -decorated with get or post-> APIRouter
FastAPI -owns self.router-> APIRouter
APIRouter -creates one per path-> APIRoute
APIRoute -calls-> get_request_handler
get_request_handler -runs-> solve_dependencies
solve_dependencies -validates via-> ModelField
get_request_handler -serializes via-> ModelField
ModelField -delegates to-> Pydantic
FastAPI -subclasses-> Starlette
FastAPI -builds schema with-> get_openapi
FastAPI -serves-> Swagger UI and ReDoc pages
get_openapi -reads-> APIRoute
solve_dependencies -calls-> Security schemes
get_request_handler -records request data in-> Telemetry
Telemetry -uses-> OpenTelemetry API
Uvicorn and fastapi-cli -serve-> FastAPI
scripts/docs.py -embeds docs_src examples of-> Path operation functions
tests with pytest -exercise-> FastAPI
